  "prefLabel": "Pod 104.02 Custodian of Records",
  "priorExpiration": "1998-05-08",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pod 104.02 Custodian of Records. The executive director of the office of professional licensure and certification shall be the custodian of its records and shall respond to requests to examine those portions of the board's records which are subject to public inspection or which may otherwise be properly examined by the person requesting access.\n\nSource. #5391, eff 5-8-92, EXPIRED: 5-8-98\n\nNew. #7816, eff 1-7-03; ss by #14372, eff 9-19-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pod100-500.html"
